  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc4/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review @100b6fbb6e: fixture with the same playbook at site.yml and at scripts/ci/setup/build-environment.yml (qemu layout, no ansible.cfg). find_ansible_files returned only site.yml. The survey tagged the nested copy language=yaml kind=file, while the root copy got ansible playbook/task symbols. The nomination logic (yaml_ansible.py:144-232) is unchanged in substance since 06feb2b3a5 (WI-jifog beside-arm). Precision and cost of nominating every YAML file are still unmeasured. MECHANISM: find_ansible_files only shape-checks YAML at the repo root, in an Ansible-named dir, or beside one; play-shaped YAML anywhere else is never nominated."  # b764
